{"4041590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Base Breakers", "steam_appid": 4041590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base Breakers is a <strong>chaotic</strong> team-based vehicle combat game for up to 8 players. Upgrade your vehicles, earn credits to buy better weapons, shields, and drones - then blow the enemy base to pieces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicles:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tank - Armored and slow. Hard to kill, hard to ignore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy - Big guns and proximity mines. Area control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jeep - Fastest ground vehicle and the only one that can capture flags.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helicopter - Strafes in any direction. Agile but fragile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jet - Carpet bombing runs at top speed. Glass cannon.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deathmatch - Kill everything. Most kills wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the Flag - Break into the enemy base, find their flag, grab it with a jeep, and bring it home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War - Destroy bases, capture flags, and rack up battle points. Everything you do counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horde (Co-op) - Survive waves of enemies with your team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base Breakers is a <strong>chaotic</strong> team-based vehicle combat game for up to 8 players. Upgrade your vehicles, earn credits to buy better weapons, shields, and drones - then blow the enemy base to pieces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicles:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tank - Armored and slow. Hard to kill, hard to ignore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy - Big guns and proximity mines. Area control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jeep - Fastest ground vehicle and the only one that can capture flags.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helicopter - Strafes in any direction. Agile but fragile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jet - Carpet bombing runs at top speed. Glass cannon.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deathmatch - Kill everything. Most kills wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the Flag - Break into the enemy base, find their flag, grab it with a jeep, and bring it home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War - Destroy bases, capture flags, and rack up battle points. Everything you do counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horde (Co-op) - Survive waves of enemies with your team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Chaotic team-based vehicle combat for up to 8 players. Blow everything to pieces in tanks, heavies, jeeps, helicopters, and jets across Deathmatch, CTF, War, and co-op Horde.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041590/d04aeca2211e535d6367c7c48ec1218b84d07794/header.jpg?t=1775515816", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041590/82a3ff4221ce5545acaf6da98e103f5b47419bf8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775515816", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041590/82a3ff4221ce5545acaf6da98e103f5b47419bf8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775515816", "website": "https://spacebacon.com.au/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core it-4590 / AMD FX 8350 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDI